{"id": "lzu-001", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大转专业是不是一定得降一级？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/332964999", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-zhuanye-2025", "page": null, "clause": "第十七条"}, {"doc_id": "lzu-zhuanye-2025", "page": null, "clause": "第十四条"}], "answer_hint": "不是一律降级：接收学院方案要写明降级要求；获准转专业后由接收学院结合学生意愿、教学计划和修读情况综合评估，经本人确认后编入相应年级。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-002", "school": "lzu", "question": "我在兰大已经大二了，还能转到别的学院去吗？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/398239016", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-zhuanye-2025", "page": null, "clause": "第十二条"}], "answer_hint": "大一可全校范围转；大二只能在学科相近学院间转；大三只能在所在学院内转。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-003", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大转专业，挂过科会不会直接被刷掉？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/331308930", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-xueji-2026", "page": 12, "clause": null}], "answer_hint": "学籍管理办法第三十六条规定学院接收转专业学生时不得把成绩高低和是否挂科列为限制性要求（外语类专业可提语言能力要求）。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-004", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大优秀学生奖学金一二三等各是多少钱？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/327203590", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-jiangxuejin-2022", "page": 2, "clause": null}], "answer_hint": "一等每生每年3000元，二等2000元，三等1500元。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-005", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大评奖学金算综测时，任选课成绩算不算进去？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/p/8208600904", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-jiangxuejin-2022", "page": 10, "clause": null}, {"doc_id": "lzu-jiangxuejin-2022", "page": 9, "clause": null}], "answer_hint": "综测中学业成绩占60%，以成绩单中必修课和限选课平均学分绩为准，任选课不计入；素质测评占40%。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-006", "school": "lzu", "question": "在兰大申请了课程免修，学分和绩点怎么算？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/p/9328574075", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-xueji-2026", "page": 5, "clause": null}, {"doc_id": "lzu-xueji-2026", "page": 6, "clause": null}], "answer_hint": "免修课程直接获得学分、计入成绩单，但不计绩点；思政课、体育课、军训军理、实验实习、毕业论文等不得免修。", "note": "原帖未说明本科/研究生，按本科学籍办法作答"}
{"id": "lzu-007", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大成绩出来以后还能去找老师改分吗？", "type": "refuse", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7692151398", "gold": [], "answer_hint": "已收录文件没有成绩更正/改分规定，应拒答并建议向开课单位或教务处咨询成绩复核。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-008", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大保研率大概多少？本校外校各占多少？", "type": "refuse", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://tieba.baidu.com/p/6179838288", "gold": [], "answer_hint": "文件只有2026年推免名额（1408个），没有保研率和去向比例，应拒答保研率。", "note": ""}
{"id": "lzu-009", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大普通专业班想保研，综测要排前百分之多少？四级要考多少分？", "type": "answerable", "subtype": null, "source_type": "public", "source_url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/368897752", "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-tuimian-2026", "page": 3, "clause": null}, {"doc_id": "lzu-tuimian-2026", "page": 4, "clause": null}], "answer_hint": "专业班前三年（五年制前四年）综测排名前50%（含）可申请；国家级基地班前80%，省级基地班前60%；CET-4须达425分及以上（部分招生类型除外）。", "note": "2026年推免办法，次年可能变"}
{"id": "lzu-010", "school": "lzu", "question": "兰大奖助办法里写国家奖学金8000、励志5000，现在还是这个数吗？", "type": "table", "subtype": "conflict", "source_type": "doc", "source_url": null, "gold": [{"doc_id": "lzu-jiangxuejin-2022", "page": 2, "clause": null}, {"doc_id": "national-jzxj-2024", "page": null, "clause": "一（一）"}, {"doc_id": "national-jzxj-2024", "page": null, "clause": "一（二）"}, {"table": "national_aid", "where": "name IN ('国家奖学金','国家励志奖学金') AND stage='本专科'"}], "answer_hint": "兰大2022年办法写的是8000元/5000元；财教〔2024〕181号从2024年起把本专科国家奖学金提到每生每年10000元、国家励志奖学金提到6000元，应以国家新标准为准。", "note": ""}
